msgid "The GPU node was not removed because GPU records belong to it. Disable it instead; GPU records are never deleted."
msgstr "Tsy voaisotra ny tendro GPU satria misy firaketana GPU miankina aminy. Akatony fotsiny izy; tsy fafana mihitsy ny firaketana GPU."

