#: lib/NodesPage.php
msgid "An absent GPU stays an index of the data query, so its graphs and RRD files stay attached and show a gap. Removing it from the data query stops that: at the next reindex Cacti no longer lists it, its graphs stop updating and its data sources show as orphaned, and its RRD files and graphs are kept until you delete them. The GPU record stays, and the GPU returns to the data query if it is reported again."
msgstr "Mijanona ho index ao amin'ny fanontaniana angona ny GPU tsy eo, ka mijanona ho miraikitra sy mampiseho banga ny kisariny sy ny rakitra RRD-ny. Ny fanesorana azy amin'ny fanontaniana angona dia mampijanona izany: amin'ny fanavaozana index manaraka dia tsy tanisan'ny Cacti intsony izy, mijanona tsy mihavao ny kisariny ary miseho ho kamboty ny loharanon'angonany, ary tazomina ny rakitra RRD-ny sy ny kisariny mandra-pamafanao azy ireo. Mijanona ny firaketana GPU, ary miverina ao amin'ny fanontaniana angona ny GPU raha tatiterina indray izy."

