msgstr "Mariho ho Tsy Hita Rehefa Afaka"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Consecutive successful collections that must miss a GPU before it is marked absent, from 1 to 100. A failed collection, or one that reports no GPUs, never counts. Absent GPUs keep their records and history and are never deleted automatically."
msgstr "Fanangonana mahomby mifanesy tsy mahita GPU alohan'ny hanamarihana azy ho tsy hita, manomboka amin'ny 1 ka hatramin'ny 100. Tsy isaina mihitsy ny fanangonana tsy nahomby na izay tsy mitatitra GPU. Mitazona ny firaketany sy ny tantarany ireo GPU tsy hita ary tsy voafafa ho azy mihitsy."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "GPU Collection"
msgstr "Fanangonana GPU"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Stale After"
msgstr "Lany Andro Rehefa Afaka"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds after the tool took a sample that its values stop being graphed, from 60 to 86400. An older value is reported as unknown, so a stopped collection shows as a gap, never as a flat line. The GPU age value keeps counting so it can be alerted on."
msgstr "Segondra aorian'ny nakàn'ny fitaovana santionany vao mitsahatra ny fanaovana grafika ny sandany, manomboka amin'ny 60 ka hatramin'ny 86400. Tatitra ho tsy fantatra ny sanda taloha kokoa, ka miseho ho banga ny fanangonana nijanona fa tsy ho tsipika mahitsy mihitsy. Mitohy ny fanisana ny faharetan'ny GPU mba hahafahana mandefa fampitandremana momba izany."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Fanesorana"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Keep Plugin Tables on Uninstall"
msgstr "Tazomy ny tabilaon'ny plugin rehefa manaisotra"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin keeps its node and GPU records. Clear it to have the uninstall drop them; export them first from GPU Nodes. Cacti devices, data sources, graphs, and RRD files are never touched either way."
msgstr "Rehefa voamarika, ny fanesorana ny plugin dia mitazona ny firaketana node sy GPU. Esory ny marika mba hamafan'ny fanesorana azy ireo; aondrano aloha avy ao amin'ny GPU Nodes izy ireo. Tsy kitihina mihitsy ny fitaovana Cacti, ny loharanon-drakitra, ny grafika ary ny rakitra RRD na izany na tsy izany."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Remove the plugin's Cacti objects on uninstall"
msgstr "Esory ny singa Cacti an'ny plugin mandritra ny fanesorana"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin also removes the GPU device template, data query, data template, and graph templates it imported, each only where nothing outside the plugin uses it, and the GPU data query XML it wrote, only if the file is unchanged. It never deletes RRD files, devices, graphs, or data sources; templates those still use are kept."
msgstr "Rehefa voamarika, ny fanesorana ny plugin dia manala ihany koa ny modely fitaovana GPU, ny fangatahana rakitra, ny modely rakitra ary ny modely grafika nafarany, samy esorina ihany raha tsy misy zavatra ivelan'ny plugin mampiasa azy, ary ny XML fangatahana rakitra GPU nosoratany raha toa ka tsy niova ilay rakitra. Tsy mamafa rakitra RRD, fitaovana, grafika, na loharanon-drakitra mihitsy izy; tazonina ireo modely mbola ampiasain'ireny."

